.SH SEE ALSO
.sp
.LP
\fBumem_alloc\fR(3MALLOC), \fBumem_cache_create\fR(3MALLOC),
\fBumem_debug\fR(3MALLOC), \fBattributes\fR(5)
.SH NOTES
.sp
.LP
Hook functions must be thread-safe if called from multiple threads.
.sp
.LP
Statistics tracking has minimal overhead (atomic counter updates) and is
suitable for production use.
.sp
.LP
The hook structure must remain valid while registered. Do not free or modify
it until after calling \fBumem_hook_unregister()\fR.
.sp
.LP
Hook names must be unique. Attempting to register a duplicate name fails.
